  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b606849240eb80e967b7dcbd26a26c93467afedeff33555a65e0105f2c289abe",
      "text": "酒店自助餐报道的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:098b3440338aa521a04edc07003ffd1a3090e8c355ae9a448043e166dfd1003b",
      "text": "收到看过的节目的邀约，\n真的很让人高兴呢～。而且还是美食环节！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:560257b114d888eb9726b5b903cb79f94c22816f370975a4e22d93b481f3eeef",
      "text": "可以尽～情吃喜欢的东西对吧？\n好期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:960863990e79af4c6ea991740732b991de8bda0eb9c3b3340be7169686434a70",
      "text": "拿到了菜单当资料，\n翔太先生已经决定好想吃什么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a78367548944feaa5c3a3833f5a4e39eeaf8a54ef8c04be9ce0c803f10395379",
      "text": "还没！因为我喜欢的菜品\n有好多好多嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f19cbf4dfac7e385d5672d644d87cbd549752fa1a7777bbec9ddd936f279a8",
      "text": "所以啊，为了能大吃特吃，\n我可是饿着肚子过来的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa5b9303b8f0ed9dec96c964dedb3da999d05a2fa7e7d2887bff86997acdc115",
      "text": "节目方面也希望能品尝各种各样的菜肴，\n真是让人放心呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1943a88845ef16a6876ca3facfb3a72ebddc1f2a034251d8ff4d2ab7872e59",
      "text": "包在我身上吧！\n我会把挑选的菜品介绍得极具魅力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:517a28424773fc60cde04286fe4aec75397913636bb5a6fe45519d2e19b6c806",
      "text": "我要让观众看了之后，\n立刻就想去吃自助餐才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:714e13d6157787a16438bc37b92fe553283eb766f41902d7d2421a5a139f7f64",
      "text": "这才是翔太先生。那就拜托你带来\n能勾起大家食欲的报道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_01:1_5_002_01:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f173ac3a4bbe3821e6a2f164d696a3dd9a3efd84df33f004ab1ff5776e898c",
      "text": "交给我吧。而且那家酒店的甜点也是出了名的\n好吃呢～。嘿嘿，好期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
